{"id":5384,"date":"2025-12-08T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2025-12-08T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=5384"},"modified":"2025-11-06T14:37:21","modified_gmt":"2025-11-06T13:37:21","slug":"take-advantage-of-the-festive-season-and-increase-your-sales","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/take-advantage-of-the-festive-season-and-increase-your-sales\/","title":{"rendered":"Take advantage of the festive season and increase your sales!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a business owner, you know how important visibility is, and the holidays are the perfect time to take advantage of that! Holidays are full of business opportunities, but successfully maximizing them involves more than just offering discounts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It&#8217;s all about experience, relevance, and timing. With proper planning, you can transform your online store into a festive experience that attracts customers and leads to conversions. This blog post provides step-by-step instructions, along with handy Webador tips you can implement immediately.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #1: Create a holiday calendar<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A good start is half the battle, so start by creating an overview of all the holidays relevant to your business. First, it&#8217;s important to have an overview of important holidays.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don&#8217;t just think about the big holidays like Christmas or Easter, but also about smaller events like Animal Day, Black Friday or National Compliment Day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Tip:<\/strong>\u00a0Use\u00a0calendars, such as Google calendar. Write down the days that are interesting to you, and think in advance about which products or promotions you want to highlight.<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #2: Give your webshop a festive makeover<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your website is your digital storefront, and during the holidays, you want to get customers in the right mood straight away. A few small adjustments can help you achieve this:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Visual Adjustments:<\/strong>\u00a0Change your banner to a theme-related image (e.g., Christmas lights, Easter eggs, roses, etc.)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Color Accents:<\/strong>\u00a0Use subtle color accents that match the holiday.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Theme pages:<\/strong>\u00a0Create a dedicated page in your Webador webshop for limited-time products, such as Christmas gifts or Mother&#8217;s Day selections. This helps customers quickly find the right product.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #3: Use WebadorFeatures<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">During the holidays, it&#8217;s crucial to encourage customers to make quick decisions. Webador offers several tools for this:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Discount codes<\/strong>\u00a0: Easily activate a discount code for a specific period. This creates urgency and motivates customers to order immediately.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Call-to-Action:<\/strong>\u00a0Make your buttons clear and engaging, for example, &#8220;Shop your Christmas gift here&#8221; or &#8220;Discover our Valentine&#8217;s Day selection.&#8221;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Customize Product Descriptions<\/strong>\u00a0: Add text to the descriptions of relevant products, such as \u201cThe perfect gift for under the tree.\u201d<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With these features you can optimally use the power of Webador, without needing any technical knowledge.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"939\" height=\"796\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-06-142940.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5386\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-06-142940.png 939w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-06-142940-300x254.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-06-142940-768x651.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 939px) 100vw, 939px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #4: Communicate and stay visible<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Without good communication, customers won&#8217;t know you&#8217;re running a promotion. So make sure you actively promote your holiday offering:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Social Media<\/strong>\u00a0: Show how your products are perfect for the holidays. Share inspiring photos, gift ideas, or short videos showcasing your products. Use tools like\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.canva.com\/\">Canva<\/a>\u00a0to easily create beautiful visuals.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Blogs<\/strong>\u00a0: Write a blog post about a holiday, for example, &#8220;Top 10 Christmas Gifts&#8221; or &#8220;Get Ready for Valentine&#8217;s Day&#8221; and link to your own products.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #5: Focus on customer experience<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">During the holidays, it&#8217;s all about experience. Customers aren&#8217;t just buying a product; they&#8217;re also buying the feeling they get from it. Especially during these times, you can make a difference with a personal approach.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A small gesture can make a big difference. Add something extra to your order, like a handwritten card with a personal message. Such a simple gesture shows that your business is both thoughtful and loving.<br>You can also add a small surprise, like a sample of a new product. This way, you&#8217;ll surprise your customer and increase the likelihood of them ordering again.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The holidays are also the perfect time to show what happens behind the scenes. Customers love seeing their order being carefully packed or seeing your studio in festive spirit.<br>This kind of behind-the-scenes content builds recognition and trust. People feel a stronger connection with your brand, making them more likely to order from you again.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready to generate more revenue?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Maximizing on holidays is a great way to boost your sales in a short time. It requires planning and creativity, but with Webador, you have all the tools you need to fully prepare your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start creating your own website today. Which holiday is first on your calendar?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your websi